  "details": "Current issues:\n\n1. Ban from Group button shows up, but does not work in instances where you don't have access to moderate for, assuming you can pre-emptively ban for another group.\n\n2. Ban from Group button only shows up on QM profile menu, via Here tab or capsule click; does not show up on MM profile menus.\n\n3. Ban from Group button is underneath Avatar Interactions, and button placement does not look consistent.\n\n4. Ban from Group icon is the same as the Invite to Group icon.\n\n5. Clicking on yourself in the Here tab will present the Ban from Group button (kekw). It doesn't work (kekw+1); see rule 1. The prompt to ban yourself shows up if you ARE hosting an instance you can moderate for. Clicking yes does nothing for the group owner.\n\nVideo: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1113633296954433556/banfromgroup.mp4\n\nDiscord embed: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1113633297797500968",
